(za)any order, direction or approval of a Court under any provision of Parts 4A and 4B of the Monetary Authority of Singapore Act 1970 as in force immediately before the date of commencement of section 205(2)(b) and (c) of this Act and which was in force immediately before that date continues as an order, direction or approval of the Court under the corresponding provision of Part 7 or 8 of this Act;
